href=\"../about.html\">About Us</a><a href=\"../blog.html\">Blog</a><a href=\"../news.html\">News</a><a href=\"../whitepapers.html\">Whitepapers</a><a href=\"../contact.html\">Contact</a></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-nav-actions\">\n<a class=\"mobile-action-wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985?text=Hello%20BestPackFactory%2C%20I%20need%20a%20custom%20packaging%20quote.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp Quote</a>\n<a class=\"mobile-action-email\" href=\"mailto:lisa@colorprintingpackage.com?subject=Packaging Inquiry\">Email Inquiry</a>\n</div>\n</div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobile-backdrop\"></div></header>\n\n<main class=\"section article-detail geo-article\">\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\">Sliding Drawer Box · Luxury Packaging</div>\n  <h1>Sliding Drawer Box Packaging Guide for Perfume, Jewelry and Gift Sets</h1>\n  <p class=\"tech-note\">A procurement guide for sliding drawer box packaging covering structure, sleeves, pull tabs, inserts, material choice and logistics.</p>\n  <section class=\"ai-snapshot quick-answer-box\">\n    <h2>Quick Answer</h2>\n    <p>A sliding drawer box is ideal when the brand wants a controlled reveal and strong unboxing experience. Buyers should define sleeve thickness, drawer clearance, pull tab, insert fit and anti-scratch protection before production.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"tech-spec-section geo-table-block\">\n    <h2>Parameter Table</h2>\n    <div class=\"spec-scroll\"><table class=\"technical-spec-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Structure</th><td>Outer sleeve + inner drawer, optional ribbon pull, thumb notch, paperboard tray or EVA / foam insert.</td></tr><tr><th>Best products</th><td>Perfume, jewelry, candle, tea, chocolate, cosmetics, accessories and gift sets.</td></tr><tr><th>Design point</th><td>Allow enough drawer clearance so the box opens smoothly after paper wrapping and lamination.</td></tr><tr><th>Finish options</th><td>Hot foil, embossing, soft-touch lamination, spot UV, texture paper and inside printing.</td></tr><tr><th>Logistics note</th><td>Drawer boxes need careful carton packing to avoid sleeve deformation.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </section>\n  <section><h2>Why drawer boxes work for luxury goods</h2><p>The opening motion creates a reveal moment, which makes sliding drawer packaging useful for perfume, jewelry, candle and premium gift sets.</p></section>\n  <section><h2>Manufacturing and logistics workflow</h2><p>BestPackFactory can support dieline, white sample, printed sample, insert testing, bulk production and export packing. A drawer box project should be tested with the actual product, not only empty packaging.</p></section>\n<section class=\"rfq-checklist\"><h2>Procurement Checklist</h2><ol><li>Send product dimensions and desired reveal direction.</li><li>Choose pull tab, ribbon, notch or no-pull clean style.</li><li>Confirm insert tolerance with actual product sample.</li><li>Test drawer sliding friction on pre-production sample.</li><li>Confirm whether each box needs polybag or tissue protection.</li></ol></section><section class=\"faq-block\"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>What is a sliding drawer box?</summary><p>It is a packaging structure with an outer sleeve and inner drawer that slides out to reveal the product.</p></details><details><summary>Is a sliding drawer box suitable for jewelry?</summary><p>Yes, especially with foam insert, EVA insert, velvet lining or paperboard insert.</p></details><details><summary>What is the biggest production risk?</summary><p>The main risk is drawer friction or misfit caused by tolerance, lamination thickness or insert error.</p></details></section><section class=\"rfq-template-box\"><h2>CTA: Ask Lisa for a packaging strategy quote</h2><p>Send product size, target quantity, artwork status, required finish, destination country and launch deadline. BestPackFactory can connect strategy, design, sampling, manufacturing and logistics into one B2B packaging plan.</p><div class=\"rfq-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"../contact.html\">Request Factory Quote</a><a class=\"btn light\" href=\"../products.html\">View Packaging Products</a></div></section><section><h2>Related Pages</h2><ul class=\"internal-links\"><li><a href=\"../products/luxury-magnetic-boxes.html\">Luxury Magnetic Boxes</a></li><li><a href=\"../products/custom-cosmetic-packaging-boxes.html\">Custom Cosmetic Packaging Boxes</a></li><li><a href=\"../products/custom-boxes.html\">Custom Boxes</a></li></ul></section></main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div>\n<h3>BestPackFactory</h3>\n<p>B2B custom packaging manufacturer for boxes, bags, labels, bottles, tins and printing.</p>\n<p><div class="contact-line-beautified"><span>Lisa Wu</span><span>lisa@colorprintingpackage.com</span><span>WhatsApp +86 158 8653 0985</span></div></p>\n<p>Address: Printing Industrial Park, Longhua District, Shenzhen, Guangdong Province, 518109, China</p>\n</div>\n<div><h3>Products</h3><a href=\"../products.html\">All Products</a><a href=\"../products/luxury-magnetic-boxes.html\">Magnetic Boxes</a><a href=\"../products/flexible-packaging.html\">Flexible Packaging</a><a href=\"../products/paper-bags.html\">Paper Bags</a></div>\n<div><h3>Inquiry</h3><a href=\"../contact.html\">Request Quote</a><a href=\"mailto:lisa@colorprintingpackage.com\">Email Lisa</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat\">\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__head\">Need Custom Packaging?</div>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__body\">\n<strong>MOQ 500 PCS · Fast Factory Quote</strong>\n<p>Click below to contact us quickly by WhatsApp or email. We can help with dieline, samples, printing, materials and worldwide shipping.</p>\n<a class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn--wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985?text=Hello%20BestPackFactory%2C%20I%20need%20a%20custom%20packaging%20quote.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n<a class=\